{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "7e276815-9f47-4258-a128-ae3d01f585bc",
    "name": "自贡彩灯节 · 票务系统推送模拟（售票主机后台服务）",
    "description": "按 P1–P7 顺序向售票主机后台服务单向推送 7 类状态消息，模拟票务系统。\n\n使用方式：\n1. 导入本集合，确认集合变量 baseUrl（默认 http://127.0.0.1:8080）\n2. 从「① P1 接待唤醒」开始，自上而下逐条 Send\n3. 每一步的返回体里带 state / page，可对照信息显示终端 http://127.0.0.1:8080/terminal/\n\n说明：票务系统 → 后台服务为单向推送，后台不向票务下发任何数据。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "① P1 接待唤醒",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "P1 创建会话 · 设备自检",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/session/create",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "session",
                "create"
              ]
            },
            "description": "创建售票会话，返回 session_id 并写入集合变量 sessionId"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const r = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (r.session_id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('sessionId', r.session_id); }",
                  "pm.test('code=0', () => pm.expect(r.code).to.eql(0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
